 rselves with Divine Feminine rose frequencies. We remember our rose hearts
  with deep ceremony that utilizes ceremonial oils to awaken these Magdalen
 e Codes in your DNA and support you on your path. Connect in sisterhood in
  a sacred space at 510 Lewis Rd\, Santa Rosa.\n**We wear red**! Adorn your
 self to your own comfort level to express your own Goddess self.\nBring yo
 ur journal\, altar item\, and water bottle or mug for tea. Don't miss out 
 on this special gathering!\nREGESTER HERE: [EVENTBRITE](https://www.eventb
 rite.com/e/goddess-circle-magdalene-rose-temple-tickets-1982719717047?utm-
