SUMMARY:Goddess Circle: Isis & The Solar Priestess
DESCRIPTION:The Unstruck Drum Center for Shamanism and Healing\nGoddess Ci
 rcle is a safe space to meet in Sisterhood. We will pass the talking stick
 \, share our truth\, and use this space to learn about a Goddess each mont
 h to awaken the Goddess within you. To remember your sovereignty and conne
 ct with your highest and most divine parts.\n\n[REGESTER HERE](https://www
 .eventbrite.com/e/1991405177493?aff=oddtdtcreator)\nWe wear GOLD!\n\nIn Se
 ptember\, we meet in the Golden Temple of Isis and awaken the codes of the
  Solar Priestess. Up until now\, the Priestesses have been the keeper of t
 he moon time\, of dream time.\nUsing the Ankh\, we will awaken the Solar P
 riestess within you so that you may step into the Sun and shine your brigh
 test light.\n\n**Bring an Ankh of your own to have it blessed and charged 
 by the circle. We Wear GOLD!!**\n\n[REGESTER HERE](https://www.eventbrite.
 com/e/1991405177493?aff=oddtdtcreator)
