SUMMARY:Medicine Drum Workshop
DESCRIPTION:The Unstruck Drum Center for Shamanism and Healing\n[REGESTER 
 HERE](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/medicine-drum-workshop-tickets-19848304
 61340)\nEvery indigenous culture throughout the world uses frame drums in 
 ceremony. Learn about the tradition of the Medicine Drum in song and sound
  for healing the body and connection with the Spirit.\nAll materials provi
 ded to create a 16" frame drum\, natural deer hide\, and beater.\nJoin for
  this day of ritual\, learning\, and creating the medicine drum that is an
  expression of your soul.\n[REGESTER HERE](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/me
 dicine-drum-workshop-tickets-1984830461340)\n**Please bring:**\nWater bott
 le/mug for tea\nJournal and pen\nAltar item (something sacred to charge on
  the altar)
