 )\\***\nJoin Mother Bear Charlotte from The Unstruck Drum and Shoshana Heb
 shi from Revolution Yoga for this weekend of deep communion with nature. Y
 ou will learn to tune in so deeply that you can feel the voice of Mother E
 arth.\nYou will experience a Shamanic drum journey to meet with your spiri
 t animals in the tradition of our ancestral elders. Including daily invigo
 rating yoga practice with Shoshana\, all levels welcome!\n**\\*[REGESTER H
 ERE](https://ratnaling.secure.retreat.guru/program/rooted-in-nature-2/)\\*
