SUMMARY:Goddess Circle: Witch Magic
DESCRIPTION:The Unstruck Drum Center for Shamanism and Healing\n[REGESTER 
 HERE](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/goddess-circle-witch-magic-tickets-1991
 406036061)\nGoddess Circle is a safe space to meet in Sisterhood. We will 
 pass the talking stick\, share our truth\, and use this space to learn abo
 ut a Goddess each month to awaken the Goddess within you. To remember your
  sovereignty and connect with your highest and most divine parts.\n\n**We 
 wear BLACK!**\n\nIn October\, we meet in the Temple of the Witch and work 
 with the wounds that keep us small. There is a wound inside of you that is
  afraid to cast your magic and publicly claim your intuition and powers of
  creation.\nPriestess Lily Love joins Mother Bear Charlotte in this specia
 l circle so that you can practice your magic and bring to life all that yo
 u desire.\n\n**We Wear BLACK!!**\n\n[REGESTER HERE](https://www.eventbrite
 .com/e/goddess-circle-witch-magic-tickets-1991406036061)
